            "I will be honest with you: faithful, Bible-loving Christians read some end-time passages differently. Revelation 20 speaks of a thousand years when Satan is bound and the saints reign with Christ. Some believe Christ will return before a literal thousand-year reign on earth. Others understand the thousand years as the present reign of Christ from heaven during the church age. Others expect the gospel to bring a long season of blessing before He comes. Among those who expect a future reign, there are further discussions about the timing of the rapture and the tribulation.",
